  "summary": "返回数组中所有奇数长度连续子数组的元素和总和。",
  "insight": "元素 arr[i] 被包含在 (i+1)(n-i) 个子数组中，其中奇数长度数量是总数向上取半，即 (total+1)/2。按贡献累加。",
  "pitfalls": [
    "计数包含所有起止点组合",
    "奇数子数组数量向上取半",
    "每个元素按出现次数加权"
  ],
  "solutions": [
    {
      "id": "per-index-contribution",
      "title": "逐元素贡献计数",
      "kind": "最优",
      "idea": "计算每个位置参与奇数长度子数组的次数。",
      "steps": [
        "对 i 计算 total=(i+1)*(n-i)",
        "oddCount=(total+1)/2",
        "answer+=arr[i]*oddCount"
      ],
      "complexity": {
        "time": "O(n)",
        "space": "O(1)"
      },
      "files": {
        "java": "solutions/per-index-contribution/Solution.java",
        "kotlin": "solutions/per-index-contribution/Solution.kt",
        "cpp": "solutions/per-index-contribution/solution.cpp"
      }
    }
  ]
